(    1) MODULE SPP_MOD
(    2) 
(    3) ! Purpose :
(    4) ! -------
(    5) !    Define types for the SPP scheme, which represents model uncertainties
(    6) !    with Stochastically Perturbed Parameterisations.
(    7) 
